            <ArticleTitle>Twelve weeks of coronary artery disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1545-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Osler said the components of the student spirit are humility, confidence, pride and hope. In this retrospective look at 12 weeks spent on a cardiology ward, medical student Paul Fedak recounts his experiences concerning a patient diagnosed with terminal coronary artery disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
